# Each capture of flow-health.spec.ts beside its frame of the approved
# prototype .superpowers/sdd/flow-health-prototype.html:
# <frame id>.png in .superpowers/sdd/flow-health-frames/ is that file rendered
# by render.cjs at the capture's 1280px viewport, dark, in the same state --
# at rest, the Never fired tile hovered, the Catching tile focused, the Never
# fired tile pressed, Rank by Run time with the Speed-up candidates tile
# pressed, and the first Project chip after All pressed. The prototype draws
# no width cap at 1280px, so no CSS is injected.
flow-health.png flow-health-prototype-rest
flow-health-tile-hover.png flow-health-prototype-tile-hover
flow-health-tile-focus.png flow-health-prototype-tile-focus
flow-health-never-fired.png flow-health-prototype-never-fired
flow-health-speed-up.png flow-health-prototype-speed-up
flow-health-project.png flow-health-prototype-project
